# Jettison environment template.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values from your Supabase project
# dashboard (Project Settings -> API). Never commit real values; .env.local
# is gitignored.

# --- Public (browser-visible) ---------------------------------------------
# These are inlined into the client bundle by Next.js. The anon key is
# intentionally public; RLS in Postgres is the protection. Do NOT put
# anything secret behind a NEXT_PUBLIC_* name.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Server-only ----------------------------------------------------------
# Service-role bypasses RLS. Server modules only. Never imported from a
# "use client" file or any module reachable from one. See
# .cursor/rules/typescript-react.mdc for the hard rule and the rg check.

# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
